ot CRM records"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600","children":"Dental charts, vaccination schedules and prescription histories have strict structure and retention expectations. A generic notes field would have been unusable."}]]}],"$L1e","$L1f"]}]]}],"$L20",null,"$L21"]}],"$L22"]}]}]]}],"$L23"]
